{"title":"Turnip","sourceTitle":"Turnip/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Turnip\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Turnip (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Turnip/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Nabo (4% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Turnip/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Navet (100% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Turnip/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Репа (4% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Turnip/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"芜菁 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"center\" style=\"background-color: #eee; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 4px; border-color: #88acf5; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 85%; width: 90%; padding: 0.2em; margin: 0.5em auto; margin-left:0px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; align-items: center; padding-left: 10px\">\n<div style=\"margin-left: 10px; text-align: left;\">\n<p>Esta página foi verificada pela última vez para a versão do Vintage Story <b>1.18.6</b>.\n</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:300px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Nabo</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Grid_turnip.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/c/cf/Grid_turnip.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"100\" data-file-height=\"100\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>64\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Comida</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Saciedade</b>\n</td>\n<td>100\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Categoria</b>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Legume\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Transitável</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Tempo fresco</b>\n</td>\n<td>21 dias\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rot#Notes\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rot\">Tempo de apodrecimento</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>4 dias\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rot#Notes\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rot\">Taxa de apodrecimento</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>0.5\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Items\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Itens</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n<b>Nabos</b> são uma fonte de alimento. As culturas de nabo amadurecem mais rapidamente do que a maioria das outras culturas.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Obtendo\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Obtendo</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Cultivo\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Cultivo</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Uso\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Uso</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Histórico\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Histórico</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Observações\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Observações</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Galeria\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Galeria</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Veja_também\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Veja também</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Referências\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Referências</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p><span id=\"Obtaining\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtendo\">Obtendo</span></h2>\n<p>Pequenos trechos de plantações de nabo podem ser encontrados durante a exploração, em áreas com os seguintes <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Temperature#Effect_on_plants\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\">temperatura</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Temperature#Effect_on_plants\" title=\"Temperature\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Weather#Precipitation\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Weather\">precipitação</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Weather#Precipitation\" title=\"Weather\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/World_generation#Tree_Generation\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/World generation\">florestamento</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/World_generation#Tree_Generation\" title=\"World generation\"> </a></span>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Parâmetro</th>\n<th>Min. valor</th>\n<th>Máx. valor\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\">Temperatura</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Temperature\" title=\"Temperature\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>26\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Weather\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Weather\">Chuva</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Weather\" title=\"Weather\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>0.38</td>\n<td>0.75\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Floresta</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0.65\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Os pedaços que satisfazem estas condições têm uma probabilidade de 3% de gerar 0-10 culturas de nabos, o que pode incluir uma mistura de culturas maduras e imaturas.\n</p><p>Ruínas superficiais e subterrâneas geralmente contêm 1 ou mais recipientes de saque rachados, que podem conter sementes de colheita. Às vezes, 5-7 sementes de nabo podem ser encontradas em um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cracked_vessel#Seed_Vessels\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cracked vessel\">Vaso rachado (Semente)</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cracked_vessel#Seed_Vessels\" title=\"Cracked vessel\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p>Nabos e sementes de nabo não podem ser comprados em nenhum <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Trading\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Trading\">comerciantes</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Trading\" title=\"Trading\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p><span id=\"Cultivation\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Cultivo\">Cultivo</span></h2>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/File:Turnip-fully-grown-crop.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/b/b9/Turnip-fully-grown-crop.png/200px-Turnip-fully-grown-crop.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"162\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/b9/Turnip-fully-grown-crop.png/300px-Turnip-fully-grown-crop.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/b9/Turnip-fully-grown-crop.png/400px-Turnip-fully-grown-crop.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"403\" data-file-height=\"327\" /></a><figcaption>Nabos maduros</figcaption></figure>\n<p>As culturas de nabo toleram temperaturas de -5 a 27°C, mas só crescem acima de 0°C. Se a temperatura descer abaixo dos -5°C ou exceder os 27°C, a cultura do nabo tornar-se-á <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Temperature#Effect_on_plants\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\">\"atrofiado\"</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Temperature#Effect_on_plants\" title=\"Temperature\"> </a></span> e começará a acumular danos. As colheitas atrofiadas de nabo produzirão 50% do normal quando colhidas.\n</p><p>As culturas de nabo consomem 30 <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming#Soil_nutrients\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">N (nitrogênio)</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming#Soil_nutrients\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span> em 5 estágios de crescimento. Durante as fases 2-4, as culturas de nabo alimentam <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bees\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bees\">abelhas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bees\" title=\"Bees\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Butterfly\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Butterfly\">borboletas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Butterfly\" title=\"Butterfly\"> </a></span>. As culturas de nabo demoram <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming#Time\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">1 mês</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming#Time\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span> a amadurecer, assumindo uma taxa de crescimento próxima dos 100%. Baixo <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming#moisture\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">umidade</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming#moisture\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span> ou <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming#Soil_nutrients\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">níveis de nutrientes</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming#Soil_nutrients\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span> pode atrasar significativamente a maturação.\n</p><p>Cada bloco de nabos maduros produzirá de 6 a 8 nabos e 1 a 2 pacotes de sementes. A colheita no estágio 4 renderá de 2 a 4 nabos, com 99% de chance de obter 1 pacote de sementes. A colheita antes do estágio 4 tem 0% de chance de obter nabos e 70% de chance de obter 1 pacote de sementes.\n</p><p><span id=\"Usage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uso\">Uso</span></h2>\n<p>Os nabos podem ser consumidos sem cozinhar e podem ser usados como ingrediente avançado <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cooking\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cooking\">cozimento</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\"> </a></span> em: \n</p>\n<ul><li>Ensopado de Carne (1-2)</li>\n<li>Ensopado de Legumes (1-4)</li>\n<li>Sopa (1-3)</li>\n<li>Mingau (1-2)</li></ul>\n<p>Cada nabo fornece 100 vegetais <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/satiety\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/satiety\">saciedade</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Satiety\" title=\"Satiety\"> </a></span>. Depois de colhidos, os nabos podem ser armazenados no inventário ou no <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/containers\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/containers\">recipientes</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Containers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Containers\"> </a></span>. Beneficiam do armazenamento num recipiente de cerâmica, de preferência num <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Room#Cellar\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Room\">despensa</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Room#Cellar\" title=\"Room\"> </a></span>, como outros vegetais. Os nabos podem ser preservados posteriormente via <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Food_preservation#Pickling\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Food preservation\">decapagem</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Food_preservation#Pickling\" title=\"Food preservation\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p>Os nabos podem ser colocados em um grande <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/trough\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/trough\">calha</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Trough\" title=\"Trough\"> </a></span> para criar <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Animal_husbandry\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Animal husbandry\">gado</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Animal_husbandry\" title=\"Animal husbandry\"> </a></span>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p><span id=\"History\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Hist.C3.B3rico\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Histórico\">Histórico</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.vintagestory.at/forums/topic/6214-homesteading-part-2-combat-update-stable-1160\">Versão 1.16.0</a> dobrou o tempo de crescimento e a produtividade para a maioria das culturas, com algumas exceções.</li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"Notes\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Observa.C3.A7.C3.B5es\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Observações\">Observações</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Jan-Jun, se a temperatura estiver entre 10-18°C às 16h, é bom para plantar sementes de nabo.</li>\n<li>Os nabos são uma cultura decente para se concentrar em um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Health#Increasing_maximum_health\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Health\">dieta balanceada</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Health#Increasing_maximum_health\" title=\"Health\"> </a></span>. Eles não toleram o calor e usam o mesmo nutriente que a maioria dos grãos, mas <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/fertilizer\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/fertilizer\">adubo</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Fertilizer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fertilizer\"> </a></span> é razoavelmente fácil de obter em quantidade.</li>\n<li>Devido ao seu rápido crescimento e lenta deterioração, os nabos são um bom alimento para <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Animal_Husbandry\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Animal Husbandry\">javalis e ovelhas domesticados</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Animal_Husbandry\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Animal Husbandry\"> </a></span>.</li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"Gallery\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Galeria\">Galeria</span></h2>\n<p><span id=\"See&#95;also\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Veja_tamb.C3.A9m\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Veja_também\">Veja também</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">Agricultura</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/fertilizante\" class=\"new\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/fertilizante (page does not exist)\">fertilizante</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/index.php?title=Fertilizante&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Fertilizante (page does not exist)\"> </a></span></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Meal\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Meal\">Refeição</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Meal\" title=\"Meal\"> </a></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Food_preservation#Pickling\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Food preservation\">Decapagem</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Food_preservation#Pickling\" title=\"Food preservation\"> </a></span></li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"References\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Refer.C3.AAncias\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Referências\">Referências</span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span>